data: {"id": "1cd9ab43fb60486a-thinking-parallel_evidence-709", "run_id": "1cd9ab43fb60486a", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "### 已确认事实\n\n1. **Pod 生命周期状态**（`kubectl_get_by_name` + Prometheus）：\n   - Pod `aiops-case-v11/workload` 状态为 `CreateContainerConfigError`，0/1 Ready，已持续 51 分钟，0 次重启。\n   - Prometheus: `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason=1` (reason=`CreateContainerConfigError`)，`kube_pod_status_phase=Pending`，`restarts=0`。\n\n2. **事件直接指向根因**（`kubectl_events`）：\n   - **`Error: couldn't find key unavailable-key in ConfigMap aiops-case-v11/workload-input`**（49 分钟前，重复 12 次）。\n\n3. **日志**（`kubectl_logs`）：\n   - 容器未启动，返回 `co", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789148348783, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

